sequenceDiagram
    participant A as API server
    participant S as Scheduler
    participant K as Karpenter
    participant E as EC2
    participant N as Node kubelet
    S->>A: Observe Pods and report unschedulable status
    K->>A: Watch unschedulable Pods and constraints
    K->>E: Provision via CreateFleet in inspected AWS provider
    E-->>N: Instance boots and initializes
    N->>A: Register Node and report conditions
    S->>A: Bind each feasible Pod to a selected Node
    N->>A: Observe bound Pods
    N->>N: Start containers and report readiness
